OL,3,GNEWSALecturer sexually assaulted uni
OL,4,Astudent on campus
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "predatory" physiotherapist and
OL,7,Fformer lecturer who "abused his
OL,8,Fposition of power" has been banned from
OL,9,Fhealth professions after sexually
OL,10,Fassaulting a student on campus.
OL,12,FAllan James McRoberts was working as a
OL,13,Fphysiotherapy lecturer at the
OL,14,FUniversity of Suffolk, in Ipswich, when
OL,15,Fthe attack on his victim took place.
OL,17,FThe 36-year-old was dismissed by the
OL,18,Fcollege and later fined and given a
OL,19,Fcommunity order at Ipswich Magistrates'
OL,20,FCourt after pleading guilty to sexual
OL,21,Fassault of a female.
